# PutCounter's RememberAmount$ remembers the counters put as an integer
# (GameEntityCounterTable.java:181-184); the reflexive "when you do" reads it
# back as `TriggerAmount$ Count$RememberedNumber/DivideEvenlyDown.2`
# (AbilityUtils.java:1991-1999). Dimension X Pizzasaur puts two +1/+1
# counters on itself, so the reflexive trigger fires once and destroys the
# opponent's Grizzly Bears (mana value 2, two counters among the human's
# permanents).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
queue targets 1
queue targets 6
resolvestack
